{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t一名43歲尼泊爾籍女子，涉嫌以懷疑外幣偽鈔兌換貨幣被捕。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n警方下午2時許，接獲油麻地彌敦道一間找換店職員報案，指有人以5張相同號碼的美元偽鈔兌換貨幣。涉案女子涉嫌「行使偽製紙幣」被捕，案件交由油尖警區刑事調查隊第六隊跟進。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：陳曉慶\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T10:03:05.837159+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T09:25:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T22:59:26.140456+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T09:58:30.081614+00:00","content_hash":"0ab11cd1d213b9561c2e4fe53fb616af978c54130ef94269fd18da976eebcbbc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}